{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/03d68dc5b62f58dae76c10b9923632a4.poster.avif?t=1771581162\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/03d68dc5b62f58dae76c10b9923632a4.webm?t=1771581162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/03d68dc5b62f58dae76c10b9923632a4.mp4?t=1771581162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Before Exit: Gas Station</strong> is <strong>anomaly-detection</strong> game with <strong>dense atmosphere</strong> and some <strong>unexpected plot-twists.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">To reveal all its secrets and fully understand it, you will have to play through the campaign several times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/55369e5d848f5fe84d08dfbf6962dcf5.poster.avif?t=1771581162\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/55369e5d848f5fe84d08dfbf6962dcf5.webm?t=1771581162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/55369e5d848f5fe84d08dfbf6962dcf5.mp4?t=1771581162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Before Exit: Gas Station</strong>, you must close your workplace at night as a gas station employee. But wait, don't gas stations stay open at night? Not in this world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your boss is very strict and he loves to save money. When night comes, it means you have to turn off the lights, close the store, and go home. It's a gas station in the middle of nowhere, so why would anyone visit this place after dark?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/90fcefc2335573005e4ce4bae876a1af.poster.avif?t=1771581162\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/90fcefc2335573005e4ce4bae876a1af.webm?t=1771581162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/90fcefc2335573005e4ce4bae876a1af.mp4?t=1771581162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Over 40 story-rich scenarios</strong>, packed with unique content, <strong>4 different endings</strong>, and <strong>6 mysterious bonus episodes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Play through the game again and again to unlock everything and uncover the <strong>true ending</strong>. Are you ready to return home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Launching with <strong>14 supported languages</strong>, full <strong>Steam Achievements</strong>, and <strong>controller support</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Like its predecessor, the game combines roguelike features with logical riddles in unique anomaly-detection genre! Play day by day to find all the assignments, and finish every task before coming back... home?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/2a7353e3c324f82342d1d94b871054eb.poster.avif?t=1771581162\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/2a7353e3c324f82342d1d94b871054eb.webm?t=1771581162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/2a7353e3c324f82342d1d94b871054eb.mp4?t=1771581162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's also the first time in the franchise you can actually walk out of your workplace before going back home! Check the fuel dispensers, and the oil stains, and get rid of the customers thinking they can fuel up at the last minute.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete every task to make your boss pleased. Do not make any mistake, as he is very observant and you are THIS close to getting fired. Anyway, have a lovely time at your charming workplace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/997de363dc9229ff9985fce8fb681edc.avif?t=1771581162\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras_big/997de363dc9229ff9985fce8fb681edc.webp?t=1771581162 width=1560 height=494 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Employee of the week","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3268520/0647e8211f3fa7a4ff4bc250038d6c83eeba564e.jpg"},{"name":"So close","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3268520/d88bdc1fa9295d33af60119c88a788ff21b7d504.jpg"},{"name":"Dirty Work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3268520/d28ace6caed5cdeada69dfd7891690aaae82ff1b.jpg"},{"name":"No Way From Here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3268520/697665766aca07f3cb891707047edeecbfc508e4.jpg"},{"name":"Termination","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3268520/6c8d316270e0ea9ebad288200b54ef3a0c4bd84a.jpg"},{"name":"Forgotten Voices","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3268520/5c622a1e346f7ed17ecf03fbdc076081f63b3aff.jpg"},{"name":"Something in the Air","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3268520/8cb3f19c55125a6f123b49095f1f956b9ca7e415.jpg"},{"name":"Haven\u2019t you forgotten something?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3268520/3a6cb7dee55dd3fa955a4895a349bd77ac749e5f.jpg"},{"name":"Fasten your seat belts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3268520/7054dfd4b051fb01d7da8af99927c621b694313a.jpg"},{"name":"Emergency Exit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3268520/c04062454d88a668a14b0d238ad1e068235fac76.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3268520?t=1771581162","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3268520?t=1771581162","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/e7782760e32be8a5ed63900e92fa2e38e2dc9369/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771581162","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/e7782760e32be8a5ed63900e92fa2e38e2dc9369/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771581162","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/03d68dc5b62f58dae76c10b9923632a4.poster.avif?t=1771581162\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/03d68dc5b62f58dae76c10b9923632a4.webm?t=1771581162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/03d68dc5b62f58dae76c10b9923632a4.mp4?t=1771581162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Before Exit: Gas Station</strong> is <strong>anomaly-detection</strong> game with <strong>dense atmosphere</strong> and some <strong>unexpected plot-twists.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">To reveal all its secrets and fully understand it, you will have to play through the campaign several times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/55369e5d848f5fe84d08dfbf6962dcf5.poster.avif?t=1771581162\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/55369e5d848f5fe84d08dfbf6962dcf5.webm?t=1771581162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/55369e5d848f5fe84d08dfbf6962dcf5.mp4?t=1771581162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Before Exit: Gas Station</strong>, you must close your workplace at night as a gas station employee. But wait, don't gas stations stay open at night? Not in this world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your boss is very strict and he loves to save money. When night comes, it means you have to turn off the lights, close the store, and go home. It's a gas station in the middle of nowhere, so why would anyone visit this place after dark?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/90fcefc2335573005e4ce4bae876a1af.poster.avif?t=1771581162\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/90fcefc2335573005e4ce4bae876a1af.webm?t=1771581162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/90fcefc2335573005e4ce4bae876a1af.mp4?t=1771581162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Over 40 story-rich scenarios</strong>, packed with unique content, <strong>4 different endings</strong>, and <strong>6 mysterious bonus episodes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Play through the game again and again to unlock everything and uncover the <strong>true ending</strong>. Are you ready to return home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Launching with <strong>14 supported languages</strong>, full <strong>Steam Achievements</strong>, and <strong>controller support</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Like its predecessor, the game combines roguelike features with logical riddles in unique anomaly-detection genre! Play day by day to find all the assignments, and finish every task before coming back... home?</stro